# CQ 26: Which communications state no quality of service?
#
# A model may leave it open, so a result here is not a defect. Test case 2
# leaves it out deliberately, since it refines the architecture rather than
# what the communication delivers.
#
# The subClassOf* step is required for the reason given at question 05: the
# reasoner materialises the direct class only, so anchoring on Association
# without it would miss every communication.
PREFIX iso7498: <https://w3id.org/aias/odp/iso7498#>
PREFIX rdfs: <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#>
SELECT ?communication WHERE {
  ?communication a/rdfs:subClassOf* iso7498:Association .
  FILTER NOT EXISTS { ?communication iso7498:hasQualityOfService ?q }
} ORDER BY ?communication
